\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30001361 (OWR-4129-003). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Mathematical Aspects of General Relativity (2009), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2009/46, pp. 2585--2646; official report source and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2009/46}.
\item[S3] Official EMS Press PDF of the same Oberwolfach report; PDF pages 20--22.
